## PHASE 3 — RED TEAM COUNCIL

**Universal rules for all advisors:**
- Stay strictly in your assigned role
- Be specific — no vague claims, name the exact thing
- Do not soften criticism to protect ego
- Classify every risk: Market | Execution | Timing | Model | Technical
- End each analysis with: *"What would have to be true to change my position?"*

