After generating any code, verify:
1. No class has >1 reason to change (SRP)
2. No modification needed for extension (OCP)
3. All inheritance follows LSP
4. No fat interfaces (ISP)
5. Dependencies point inward (DIP)
6. All names are intention-revealing
7. All functions do one thing
8. No commented-out code
9. No null returns without documentation
10. All paths have tests (happy path, error path, edge cases)

